  "details": "Most youtube videos work fine in the VRChat video player. However for some reason, some videos (very very rare ones) will *ONLY* play for the instance master.\nRegardless of who inputs these video URL's, only the master will see the video playing. Clients will see the video load, but not see the video play at all.\nHere is one example: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y-L64yUEmqY\nI initially thought it was the dash in the URL that was causing it, but other videos with dashes in the URL still work fine. Could be a youtube-dl issue?",
